      "rationale": "O daɲɛ fɔcogow: 'bolo-fitiniw' (den min ka bon ka bɔn bolo fitini ye) walima 'denw minnu bɛ bolo la bɛ labɛn' — bayɛlɛmabaga bɛ u fɛn fila fɔ."
